Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: Global Terminal closure link fixes: 14 native-provided names, seed 12 overlay 0 helpers

Run link of main 3ee693f (Nathan's builder, after 0164/0165): 14 multiple definitions and 12 undefined references.
LoadDwcOverlay/LoadOVY38/UnloadDwcOverlay/UnloadOVY38 (unk_020915B0.o), sub_0202DB54..DBA0 (unk_0202DB34.o) are already
compiled from the decomp, and ov00_021E6A70 is the Missing() trap in missing.o (the wireless error screen), so list all
14 in native-provided.json and the translator calls the compiled ones. ov00_021EC0FC/EC2A8/EC2EC/EC9E0/ECB94/ECD04/ECDC8/
FA0B4/FA0D8/FA118/FA21C/FFC18 are called by the translated overlay 38 / overlay 70 functions but nothing defines them, so
seed them into the translator (same as patch 0135). ss3ds_game.sh already re-syncs both staged JSON files.
